  "priorExpiration": "2018-10-01",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fam 405.02 Reinstatement Application Procedures. An applicant for reinstatement of certification shall submit to the board:\n\n(a) A completed application form further described in Fam 302.03;\n\n(b) Payment of the reinstatement fee set forth in Fam 304.01(e) in the form of:\n\n(1) Cash; or\n\n(2) A check or money order made payable to Treasurer, State of New Hampshire; and\n\n(c) The supporting documents further described in Fam 405.03.\n\nSource. #9672, eff 4-2-10; ss by #12507, INTERIM, eff 4-2-18, EXPIRED: 10-1-18\n\nNew. #12635, eff 10-2-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/fam100-800.html"
